          "type": "label",
          "text": "TESTING THE NEW FEATURES\n\n1. Press RUN TEST with the serial number blank.\n   The executive should refuse to start.\n\n2. Enter a serial number and RUN again.\n   The test should proceed into Setup / Main / Cleanup.\n\n3. Open the Run Report page. The test report\n   should contain the UUT field values.\n\n4. STOP / RESET, edit the serial number and run again.\n   The new execution should capture the new values.",
          "x": 755,
